</script>

<main class="lp-page belkins-page" id="simple-guide">
  <div class="lp-hero-shell"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <nav class="lp-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/resources/outbound-sales-library/">Outbound Sales Library</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">CallTeam vs Belkins</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="lp-hero">
      <div>
        <h1>CallTeam vs <span>Belkins</span>
          <small>Pricing and B2B appointment setting</small>
        </h1>
        <p class="lp-intro">Choose CallTeam for a calling campaign with follow-up and qualified meetings handed to sales. Get a Belkins quote if you need a team to run email, LinkedIn and calls together.</p>
        <div class="lp-actions">
          <a class="lp-button" href="#comparison">Compare prices and scope <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="lp-text-link" href="#callteam-vs-belkins-video" data-inline-play>See the 78-second demo <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="lp-brief belkins-price-brief" aria-labelledby="starter-price-heading">
        <h2 id="starter-price-heading">Belkins’ first ten appointments</h2>
        <p class="belkins-hero-price">{{ prices.starterTotal }}</p>
        <p>Starting total with setup included.</p>
        <a href="#starter-package">See the line items <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <nav class="lp-jump" aria-label="On this page"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <a href="#comparison">Price table</a><a href="#proof">Demo and results</a><a href="#cost-examples">Cost examples</a><a href="#compare-quotes">Compare quotes</a><a href="#questions">FAQs</a>
  </div></nav>

  <section class="lp-section belkins-first-section" id="comparison"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>CallTeam vs Belkins pricing</h2>
      <p>Published prices and terms checked <time datetime="{{ guide.checkedDate }}">{{ guide.checkedLabel }}</time>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="lp-table sg-table belkins-table" role="table">
        <caption>Three B2B lead generation offers compared by cost, scope and term</caption>
        <thead><tr role="row"><th scope="col" role="columnheader">What to compare</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">CallTeam managed calling</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Belkins managed retainer</th><th scope="col" role="columnheader">Belkins pay per appointment</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Starting price</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam managed calling"><strong>{{ prices.callTeamMonthly }} per month</strong> For campaigns with target accounts ready to call.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins managed retainer"><strong>{{ prices.belkinsMonthly }} per month</strong> Final price depends on the plan and scope.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment"><strong>{{ prices.appointmentRate }} per appointment</strong> Plus {{ prices.setupFee }} for setup. Minimum {{ prices.starterAppointments }} appointments.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Outreach</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam managed calling">Human cold calling, live voicemails, approved voicemail drops and callbacks. Email follow-up by agreement.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins managed retainer">Email and LinkedIn. Calling coverage depends on the plan.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">Email and LinkedIn. Belkins handles replies and booking.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">Term or delivery window</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam managed calling">Most campaigns start with three months.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins managed retainer">{{ prices.belkinsAgreementMonths }} months with a checkpoint at month three, per Belkins.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">The starter package is due within six months of launch.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr role="row">
            <th scope="row" role="rowheader">What sales receives</th>
            <td role="cell" data-label="CallTeam managed calling">A qualified booking with buyer context and the agreed next step in your CRM.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins managed retainer">Booked meetings and reporting. Confirm CRM updates and integration in the quote.</td>
            <td role="cell" data-label="Belkins pay per appointment">Calendar bookings and monthly reporting. Your team owns the CRM and pipeline.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="sg-sources belkins-table-sources"><a href="/pricing/">CallTeam pricing</a> · <a href="{{ sources.belkinsManaged.url }}">Belkins managed pricing</a> · <a href="{{ sources.belkinsTerms.url }}">Belkins retainer terms</a> · <a href="{{ sources.belkinsAppointments.url }}">Belkins appointment package</a></p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="proof"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Give sales a reason for the meeting</h2>
      <p>We agree on the buyer role, company fit and reason to meet before launch. A live call can confirm what the buyer wants to discuss and when it makes sense to follow up.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="belkins-proof-grid">
      {{ processVideoPreview('Watch a CallTeam campaign take shape', 'See how our team researches prospects, schedules callbacks and briefs sales.', 'callteam-vs-belkins') }}
      <article class="belkins-case">
        <h3>11 qualified SaaS demos in 90 days</h3>
        <p>We called property and site-selection teams about how they gathered market data. Buyers with a use for the software booked demos around their own research questions.</p>
        <p>Sales identified four opportunities, and two customers signed within six months.</p>
        <a href="/case-studies/saas-demo-appointment-setting/">Read the campaign and qualification criteria <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-note" id="voicemail-and-callbacks">
      <h3>How voicemail fits into the follow-up</h3>
      <p>When a call reaches voicemail, we can speak the message live or play a short recording approved for the campaign. We log the message and the next call date.</p>
      <p>On the callback, we ask about the issue we called about and find out if it warrants a meeting. <a href="/articles/b2b-cold-call-voicemail-scripts-that-create-a-reason-to-call-back/">See B2B cold call voicemail examples</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="belkins-handoff">
      <h3>Example CRM note after a callback</h3>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Buyer</dt><dd>Research director at a commercial property firm.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Callback</dt><dd>The buyer asked for a call after their project review. On that call, they confirmed two sites were still in play.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Reason to meet</dt><dd>The team pulls property and demographic data from three sources for each client report.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>For the seller</dt><dd>Compare the two markets with the buyer and their analyst. Ask who signs off on software.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <a href="/articles/how-to-hand-off-qualified-appointment-from-sdr-to-sales/">See the sales handoff guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="cost-examples"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Run the numbers before you sign</h2>
      <p>These examples use published starting rates before taxes and add-ons. Confirm Belkins’ billing currency in writing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="belkins-cost-grid">
      <article class="lp-pair-card" id="monthly-example">
        <h3>Three monthly invoices</h3>
        <dl class="belkins-cost-lines">
          <div><dt>CallTeam</dt><dd>{{ prices.callTeamMonthly }} × {{ prices.comparisonMonths }} = <strong>{{ prices.callTeamThreeMonths }}</strong></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Belkins managed</dt><dd>{{ prices.belkinsMonthly }} × {{ prices.comparisonMonths }} = <strong>{{ prices.belkinsThreeMonths }}</strong></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>With both quotes in US dollars at those rates, CallTeam costs <strong>{{ prices.threeMonthDifference }} less over three months</strong>.</p>
        <p>Six Belkins invoices at its starting rate add up to <strong>{{ prices.belkinsAgreementTotal }}</strong>. Ask what you can change at month three and how that affects what you owe.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="lp-pair-card" id="starter-package">
        <h3>Ten appointments from Belkins</h3>
        <dl class="belkins-cost-lines">
          <div><dt>Appointments</dt><dd>{{ prices.starterAppointments }} × {{ prices.appointmentRate }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>One-time setup</dt><dd>{{ prices.setupFee }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Starting total</dt><dd><strong>{{ prices.starterTotal }}</strong></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>That’s <strong>{{ prices.starterUnitCost }} per appointment including setup</strong> at the advertised floor. A missed meeting stays in the package while Belkins works to rebook it.</p>
        <p>The package covers email and LinkedIn through booking. Budget separately for any calls, account research or CRM work you need.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="choose"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Price the work that can change your quote</h2></div>
    <dl class="belkins-quote-list">
      <div><dt>Belkins calling coverage</dt><dd>Growth lists calls tied to buying signals. Growth Plus includes cold calling and voicemail. Belkins leaves the tier prices off its <a href="{{ sources.belkinsPlans.url }}">plan page</a>.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Belkins HubSpot integration</dt><dd>Belkins lists it as optional and leaves the fee unpublished. Ask who updates records and what that costs.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>CallTeam list and data</dt><dd>We can research your market and build the calling list. Ask us to price research, licensing and validation into the campaign.</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="compare-quotes"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Ask both agencies to quote the same work</h2>
      <p>Give both agencies the same buyer profile and one target account. Ask each to show how a prospect at that account would move from first contact to a qualified meeting.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="belkins-quote-list">
      <div><dt>Assign the follow-up</dt><dd>Decide who owns replies and callbacks. Ask each provider to show where those tasks appear in your CRM.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Agree on the meeting standard</dt><dd>Count a meeting once it takes place and sales accepts it. Define the buyer role and business problem that make the meeting worthwhile.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Compare cost per accepted meeting</dt><dd>Divide the total spend in a period by the meetings sales accepted in that period. Budget any invoices due after the comparison period too.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="lp-actions">
      <a class="lp-button" href="/lead-generation-proposal-comparison/">Compare your agency quotes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="lp-text-link" href="/b2b-meeting-quality-check/">Check your meeting criteria <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="sg-mid-cta">
      <p><strong>Get a CallTeam quote for your market.</strong> Bring a target account and an example of a meeting your seller would take. We’ll discuss how to reach that buyer and price the work.</p>
      <a class="lp-button" href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-booking-placement="callteam-vs-belkins">Book a free 30-minute call <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section" id="questions"><div class="lp-wrap lp-faq-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>CallTeam vs Belkins FAQs</h2></div>
    <div class="lp-faqs">{% for faq in guide.faqs %}<details><summary>{{ faq.question }}</summary><p>{{ faq.answer }}</p></details>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="lp-section lp-paper belkins-sources" id="sources"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><h2>Sources</h2></div>
    <ul>{% for key, source in sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <p>Compare more agencies in the <a href="/resources/b2b-lead-generation-pricing-report/">B2B lead generation pricing report</a> or see <a href="/services/b2b-appointment-setting/">CallTeam’s appointment-setting service</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</main>
